# Wallet and account settings. Supply service bases and the publishable identity key.
# Public settings are compiled into the browser bundle.
# Hosts, accounts, contract addresses, keys and secrets are intentionally empty.
# Defaults and readers: docs/release/variables/app-wallet.md at the repository root.
# Uncomment NEXT_PUBLIC_PAXEER_HOSTED_URL only with a nonempty HTTP(S) URL.
# Empty NEXT_PUBLIC_PNS_API_BASE uses the name helpers' same-origin default;
# a configured PWA service base must be an absolute HTTP(S) URL.

